  "details": "In a world with bloom, if your view position moves far away enough from the head you get an explosion of pure white bloom from the point where the local player head has been scaled to 0.\nIt's particularly bad when in full-body tracking and/or in a world where being seated is a common thing to do.\n\nIt is also physically painful. (You'd often hear me going \"OW ****\" when this happens.)",
